 issue.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What's the issue?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can we discuss this? \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Of course.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"What do you think?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Let's talk about it.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to set up "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to arrange things in a display "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(phrasal verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can you help me set up the stand today?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob09aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use at a convention."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": " to look around "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to look at different things"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(phrasal verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to look around at the convention."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob09aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to take a break"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to rest"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: I can't take a break until lunch."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob09aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "exhibit "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "display of art "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The comic book exhibits are fantastic."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob09aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "vendor "}, {"type":